# GraalVM CE 17 - light profile (no over-tuned G1). Timer agent still sets 1ms Windows scheduling.
# Keep flags minimal so hitreg/click cadence stays stock-like.
-XX:+UseG1GC
-XX:MaxGCPauseMillis=20
-Djava.net.preferIPv4Stack=true
-Dio.netty.leakDetection.level=DISABLED
-Dorg.lwjgl.util.NoChecks=true
